        "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1em\">Studies have shown dislocation rates in Mako Total Hip are significantly reduced compared to manual patients.<sup>7,8</sup></span></span><br>\n</p>\n",
